OL,3,GNEWSALondon Tube strike to go ahead    
OL,4,Aafter talks fail                       
OL,6,FThe RMT said it was opposed to         
OL,7,Fproposals surrounding a four-day       
OL,8,Fworking week, although the conditions  
OL,9,Fhave been accepted by the Aslef union. 
OL,10,FTfL said the changes were voluntary and
OL,11,Fwould lead to drivers working fewer    
OL,12,Fhours.                                 
